+M54/M55 production-path regressions using the runtime API regression fixture.
+The retained G95 case rejects a feed after M55 releases its spindle, then clears
+synchronization with G94. The paused-AUTO case advances an acquired M54 barrier
+using only Single Step. Select with AVAILABILITY_MCODE_REGRESSION_CASES.
+
+INI fixtures are generated by test.sh from the shared FIXTURE.BASE and local
+*.ini.in overrides. Run python3 ../runtime-availability/make-fixtures.py before
+launching an individual case directly. @unset explicitly removes an inherited
+key. Generated INIs are ignored; edit the base or the case override instead.
