new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..7ed2a46ba5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/interp/availability-mcodes/README
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Exercise the native M54/M55 joint and spindle selectors and their validation.
+
